msgstr "采样温度；默认不发送"

#: ../../configuration.md
msgid "`max_tokens`"
msgstr "`max_tokens`"

#: ../../configuration.md
msgid "`0`"
msgstr "`0`"

#: ../../configuration.md
msgid ""
"Output-token cap per model request, reasoning included; `0` leaves it to "
"the provider (Anthropic sends a conservative 8K). 16K is still reserved "
"from the input budget for the answer, trading against "
"`max_context_tokens` one for one"
msgstr ""
"每次模型请求的输出 token 上限（包含推理）；`0` 时交给 provider（Anthropic 线发送保守的 8K）。输入预算中仍预留 "
"16K 给输出，与 `max_context_tokens` 一比一此消彼长"

#: ../../configuration.md
msgid "`max_context_tokens`"
msgstr "`max_context_tokens`"

#: ../../configuration.md
msgid ""
"How much of *this* entry's model window to use; `0` inherits "
"`runtime.max_context_tokens`. Set it per entry when entries point at "
"models with different windows"
msgstr ""
"使用**该条目**模型窗口的多少；`0` 表示继承 "
"`runtime.max_context_tokens`。当各条目指向窗口大小不同的模型时，按条目分别设置。"

#: ../../configuration.md
msgid "`timeout`"
msgstr "`timeout`"

#: ../../configuration.md
msgid "`120`"
msgstr "`120`"

#: ../../configuration.md
msgid "Transport inactivity timeout in seconds"
msgstr "传输无数据时的超时秒数"

#: ../../configuration.md
msgid "`response_timeout`"
msgstr "`response_timeout`"

#: ../../configuration.md
msgid "`600`"
msgstr "`600`"

#: ../../configuration.md
msgid "Total generation limit in seconds; `0` disables it"
msgstr "完整生成的时限（秒）；设为 `0` 可禁用"

#: ../../configuration.md
msgid "`prompt_cache_key`"
msgstr "`prompt_cache_key`"

#: ../../configuration.md
msgid "Stable prompt-cache key; set `off` to omit it"
msgstr "稳定的 prompt-cache key；设置为 `off` 时不发送"

#: ../../configuration.md
msgid "`strict_tools`"
msgstr "`strict_tools`"

#: ../../configuration.md
msgid "`false`"
msgstr "`false`"

#: ../../configuration.md
msgid "Request strict function schemas where supported; toggle with `/strict`"
msgstr "在支持时请求 strict function schema；通过 `/strict` 切换"

