msgstr "由 Provider 自己执行的工具，原样透传；见下文"

#: ../../configuration.md
msgid "`chat_reasoning`"
msgstr "`chat_reasoning`"

#: ../../configuration.md
msgid "Provider-specific Chat reasoning format; normally leave on `auto`"
msgstr "Provider 特有的 Chat reasoning 格式；通常保留为 `auto`"

#: ../../configuration.md:69
msgid ""
"Streaming is enabled by default for all three protocols. If a compatible "
"endpoint does not support it, set `stream = false` in that provider "
"block, or use `/set provider.stream off` for the current session."
msgstr ""
"三种协议默认都启用流式输出。如果兼容 endpoint 不支持，可在对应 provider 配置中设置 `stream = false`，或在当前"
" session 中执行 `/set provider.stream off`。"

#: ../../configuration.md:73
msgid ""
"`timeout` detects a connection that stops delivering data. Streaming "
"reasoning can keep that timer active indefinitely, so `response_timeout` "
"separately limits the complete model response to ten minutes by default. "
"Reaching the total limit cancels the request without automatic retries; "
"set it to `0` only when deliberately allowing unbounded generations."
msgstr ""
"`timeout` 用于检测连接停止传输数据的情况。流式 reasoning 可能持续产生数据，使该计时器一直不会触发；因此 "
"`response_timeout` "
"会单独限制完整模型响应，默认十分钟。达到总时限后会取消请求且不自动重试；只有在明确需要允许无限时长生成时，才将其设为 `0`。"

#: ../../configuration.md:78
msgid ""
"For provider/model combinations with documented reasoning constraints, "
"minacode maps the selected effort to the nearest accepted value. Unknown "
"OpenAI-compatible endpoints and model names stay on the generic path "
"rather than an allowlist; set `api` and `chat_reasoning` explicitly if "
"automatic selection is wrong. `/config` shows the resolved reasoning "
"effort, while `/status` shows the active model and cache usage reported "
"by the provider."
msgstr ""
"对于有明确 reasoning 约束文档的 provider/model 组合，minacode 会把所选 effort "
"映射到最接近的可接受值。未知的 OpenAI-compatible endpoint 和模型名继续走通用路径而不是 "
"allowlist；如果自动选择不正确，请显式设置 `api` 和 `chat_reasoning`。`/config` 会显示解析后的 "
"reasoning effort，`/status` 会显示当前模型以及 provider 报告的缓存使用情况。"

#: ../../configuration.md:84
msgid "Provider-side tools"
msgstr "Provider 侧工具"

#: ../../configuration.md:86
msgid ""
"Some providers can run web search themselves; see [Provider-side "
"tools](tools.md#provider-side-tools) for what that looks like in a "
"session. List the ones you want in `builtin_tools`, written the way your "
"provider documents them:"
msgstr ""
"部分 Provider 可以自己执行联网搜索；在 session 中的实际表现见 [Provider 侧工具](tools.md"
"#provider-side-tools)。把需要的工具按 Provider 文档中的写法列在 `builtin_tools` 中："

#: ../../configuration.md
msgid "Provider"
msgstr "Provider"

#: ../../configuration.md
msgid "Entry"
msgstr "配置项"

#: ../../configuration.md
msgid "OpenAI (Responses)"
msgstr "OpenAI（Responses）"

