msgstr "OpenRouter"

#: ../../configuration.md
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"`{ type = \"openrouter:web_search\" }`; also `openrouter:web_fetch`, "
"`openrouter:datetime`"
msgstr ""
"`{ type = \"openrouter:web_search\" }`；还有 "
"`openrouter:web_fetch`、`openrouter:datetime`"

#: ../../configuration.md:107
msgid ""
"One provider configures search elsewhere, through [`extra_body"
"`](#optional-provider-settings): Qwen's Chat Completions endpoint takes "
"`enable_search`. DeepSeek has no web search."
msgstr ""
"有一个 Provider 在别处配置搜索，通过 [`extra_body`](#optional-provider-settings)：Qwen "
"的 Chat Completions endpoint 使用 `enable_search`。DeepSeek 没有联网搜索。"

#: ../../configuration.md:110
msgid ""
"Builtin tools only work with the APIs shown in the table. If you switch "
"to another API, minacode keeps the setting but does not send those tools;"
" switching back enables them again. Use `/config` to check whether they "
"are active. If minacode reports an unsupported entry, compare it with the"
" example for your provider."
msgstr ""
"Builtin tools 只适用于表中标明的 API。切换到其他 API 后，minacode "
"会保留配置，但不会发送这些工具；切换回来后会重新启用。使用 `/config` 检查工具是否生效。如果 minacode "
"报告条目不受支持，请对照对应 Provider 的示例检查。"

#: ../../configuration.md:115
msgid ""
"With `image_input = \"auto\"`, minacode sends attached images using the "
"selected standard API. A successful image request is remembered for that "
"provider and model during the session; only an explicit image-not-"
"supported response disables later image submissions. Set `on` or `off` "
"when the endpoint's capability is already known. Historical images remain"
" readable as text labels after switching to a provider or model with "
"image input disabled."
msgstr ""
"使用 `image_input = \"auto\"` 时，minacode 会使用所选的标准 API 发送附加图片。图片请求成功后，会在当前 "
"session 中为该 provider 和模型记住其支持识图；只有明确表示不支持图片的响应才会禁用后续图片提交。如果已经知道 endpoint "
"的能力，可设为 `on` 或 `off`。切换到禁用图片输入的 provider 或模型后，历史图片仍会以可读文本标签保留。"

