msgstr "`quick_hints`"

#: ../../configuration.md
msgid "Let the model offer selectable next-step chips; toggle with `/hints`"
msgstr "允许模型提供可选择的下一步 chip；可用 `/hints` 切换"

#: ../../configuration.md
msgid "`262144` (256K)"
msgstr "`262144`（256K）"

#: ../../configuration.md
msgid ""
"Default for every provider entry that does not set its own "
"`max_context_tokens`. How much of the model's context window to use, "
"which sets the automatic-compaction budget — a budget, not the window's "
"size: raise it for a 1M-window model, lower it for a smaller one"
msgstr ""
"所有未自行设置 `max_context_tokens` 的 provider 条目的默认值。表示使用模型上下文窗口的多少，它决定了自动压缩的预算"
" —— 这是预算，不是窗口本身的大小：1M 窗口的模型可以调高，更小的模型则调低。"

#: ../../configuration.md
msgid "`max_agent_steps`"
msgstr "`max_agent_steps`"

#: ../../configuration.md
msgid "`400`"
msgstr "`400`"

#: ../../configuration.md
msgid "Maximum tool steps in one turn"
msgstr "单轮任务的最大工具步数"

#: ../../configuration.md
msgid "`shell_timeout`"
msgstr "`shell_timeout`"

#: ../../configuration.md
msgid "`60`"
msgstr "`60`"

#: ../../configuration.md
msgid "Maximum shell-command lifetime, in seconds"
msgstr "shell 命令最大运行秒数"

#: ../../configuration.md
msgid "`bash_wait_timeout`"
msgstr "`bash_wait_timeout`"

#: ../../configuration.md
msgid "`10`"
msgstr "`10`"

#: ../../configuration.md
msgid ""
"Foreground wait before a running command becomes a background job; `0` "
"disables promotion"
msgstr "前台命令转为后台任务前的等待秒数；`0` 表示禁用"

#: ../../configuration.md
msgid "`max_parallel_tools`"
msgstr "`max_parallel_tools`"

#: ../../configuration.md
msgid "`4`"
msgstr "`4`"

#: ../../configuration.md
msgid ""
"Maximum read-only tool calls executed concurrently; `1` disables "
"parallelism"
msgstr "并发执行只读工具的上限；`1` 表示禁用并发"

#: ../../configuration.md
msgid "`session_retention_days`"
msgstr "`session_retention_days`"

#: ../../configuration.md
msgid "`7`"
msgstr "`7`"

#: ../../configuration.md
msgid ""
"Delete saved sessions untouched for this many days, swept in the "
"background at startup; `0` keeps them indefinitely"
msgstr "删除超过该天数未被使用的 session，启动时在后台清理；`0` 表示永久保留"

#: ../../configuration.md
msgid "`theme`"
msgstr "`theme`"

#: ../../configuration.md
msgid "Terminal theme: `auto`, `light`, or `dark`; overridden by `--theme`"
msgstr "终端主题：`auto`、`light` 或 `dark`；`--theme` 可覆盖"

#: ../../configuration.md
msgid "`worker`"
msgstr "`worker`"

#: ../../configuration.md
msgid "Let the model delegate to a second in-process session; see below"
msgstr "让模型委派给同一进程内的第二个会话；见下文"

#: ../../configuration.md
msgid "`language`"
msgstr "`language`"

#: ../../configuration.md
msgid ""
"Force the reply language (`auto` follows your messages and injects "
"nothing); set a name like `Chinese` to append a fixed `LANGUAGE OVERRIDE`"
" block to the system prompt. Change for the current session with "
"`/language`"
msgstr ""
"强制回复语言(`auto` 跟随你的消息、不注入任何内容);设置语言名(如 `Chinese`)会在系统提示词尾部追加一个固定的 "
"`LANGUAGE OVERRIDE` 块。可用 `/language` 为当前会话修改"

#: ../../configuration.md
msgid "`agents_md`"
msgstr "`agents_md`"

#: ../../configuration.md
msgid ""
"Inject the project's `AGENTS.md` (falling back to `CLAUDE.md`) into every"
" request as a bounded \"Project instructions\" section of the Environment"
" block"
msgstr ""
"将项目的 `AGENTS.md`（找不到时回退 `CLAUDE.md`）注入到每次请求，作为 Environment "
"块中一个有边界的「Project instructions」段落"

#: ../../configuration.md:140
msgid ""
"Selected tuning values can be changed for the current session with `/set`"
" (Tab completion lists the supported keys). `/yolo` toggles `yolo`."
msgstr "部分配置可以用 `/set` 在当前 session 中修改，按 Tab 可补全支持的 key。`/yolo` 用于切换 `yolo`。"

#: ../../configuration.md:143
msgid "Worker delegation"
msgstr "Worker 委派"

#: ../../configuration.md:145
msgid ""
"The `Delegate` tool and `/worker` command hand bounded tasks to a second "
"in-process session. Concepts, quick start, and what you see in the "
"terminal: [Worker delegation](worker.md)."
msgstr ""
"`Delegate` 工具和 `/worker` 命令把有边界的任务交给同一进程内的第二个会话。概念、快速上手和终端里的实际表现：[Worker "
"委派](worker.md)。"

#: ../../configuration.md:148
msgid "Worker keys inherit the `[worker]` provider entry by default:"
msgstr "worker 键默认继承 `[worker]` provider 条目："

#: ../../configuration.md
msgid "`[worker] provider`"
msgstr "`[worker] provider`"

#: ../../configuration.md
msgid "Worker provider entry key; unset disables delegation"
msgstr "worker 的 provider 条目键；不设置则禁用委派"

#: ../../configuration.md
msgid "`[worker] model`"
msgstr "`[worker] model`"

#: ../../configuration.md
msgid "inherit"
msgstr "继承"

#: ../../configuration.md
msgid "Override the entry's model; empty inherits"
msgstr "覆盖条目的模型；留空则继承"

#: ../../configuration.md
msgid "`[worker] reasoning`"
msgstr "`[worker] reasoning`"

#: ../../configuration.md
msgid "Override the entry's reasoning effort; empty inherits"
msgstr "覆盖条目的推理力度；留空则继承"

#: ../../configuration.md
msgid "`[worker] api`"
msgstr "`[worker] api`"

#: ../../configuration.md
msgid "Override the entry's wire protocol; empty inherits"
