#: ../../configuration.md:157
msgid ""
"`[runtime] worker` and `[runtime] language` are in the "
"[Runtime](#runtime) table above."
msgstr "`[runtime] worker` 和 `[runtime] language` 见上方[运行时](#runtime)表格。"

#: ../../configuration.md:159
msgid "Compaction model"
msgstr "压缩模型"

#: ../../configuration.md:161
msgid ""
"Context compaction (the summary request that makes room in the context "
"window) runs on the active provider by default. A `[compaction]` section "
"overrides it per field, mirroring `[worker]`: an empty `provider` means "
"the active provider entry, and each empty override inherits that entry's "
"value. The context budget is unaffected — requests are still prepared "
"against the active provider's window; only the summary request itself "
"uses this entry."
msgstr ""
"默认情况下，上下文压缩（为上下文窗口腾出空间的摘要请求）使用当前激活的 provider。`[compaction]` 节可以逐字段覆盖它，镜像 "
"`[worker]`：空的 `provider` 表示当前激活的 provider "
"条目，每个空的覆盖值继承该条目的值。上下文预算不受影响——请求仍按激活 provider 的窗口准备；只有摘要请求本身使用这个条目。"

#: ../../configuration.md
msgid "`[compaction] provider`"
msgstr "`[compaction] provider`"

#: ../../configuration.md
msgid "Base provider entry key; empty = the active provider"
msgstr "基础 provider 条目键；留空 = 当前激活的 provider"

#: ../../configuration.md
msgid "`[compaction] model`"
msgstr "`[compaction] model`"

#: ../../configuration.md
msgid "`[compaction] reasoning`"
msgstr "`[compaction] reasoning`"

#: ../../configuration.md
msgid "`[compaction] api`"
msgstr "`[compaction] api`"

#: ../../configuration.md:174
msgid ""
"Each provider entry can also nest its own `compaction` table "
"(`[provider.NAME.compaction]`) with the same `model`/`reasoning`/`api` "
"keys — there is no `provider` key there, the base entry comes only from "
"the global `[compaction] provider`. Per field the most specific value "
"wins: the base entry's nested table, then the global `[compaction]` "
"section, then the entry's own value."
msgstr ""
"每个 provider 条目也可以嵌套自己的 `compaction` "
"表（`[provider.NAME.compaction]`），键与全局相同（`model`/`reasoning`/`api`）——那里没有 "
"`provider` 键，base 条目只来自全局 `[compaction] provider`。逐字段取最具体的值：base "
"条目的嵌套表，然后是全局 `[compaction]` 节，最后是条目自身的值。"

#: ../../configuration.md:187
msgid ""
"Write the nested table under a *named* entry, as above. In the short "
"single-provider form, where `[provider]` holds `url` and `key` directly, "
"`[provider.compaction]` reads as a provider named `compaction` and the "
"config is rejected with `provider.active does not exist`."
msgstr ""
"像上面那样，把嵌套表写在**具名**条目下。在 `[provider]` 直接放 `url` 和 `key` 的单 provider "
"简写形式里，`[provider.compaction]` 会被读成一个名为 `compaction` 的 provider，配置会以 "
"`provider.active does not exist` 被拒绝。"

#: ../../configuration.md:191
msgid ""
"Summaries can also run on a different vendor entirely — the entry "
"supplies its own url, key, and wire protocol, so the conversation stays "
"on one host while summaries go to another:"
msgstr "摘要也可以完全跑在另一家厂商上——该条目自带 url、key 和 wire protocol，于是对话留在一个服务商，摘要发往另一个："

#: ../../configuration.md:214
msgid "Two things to check when picking a summarizer:"
msgstr ""
"挑选摘要模型时要确认两件事："

#: ../../configuration.md:216
msgid ""
"**Its window must fit the span being compacted.** A small-window model "
"asked to summarize a large conversation fails every time, and the context"
" is then trimmed without a summary."
msgstr ""
"**它的窗口必须放得下被压缩的这段对话。** 让一个小窗口模型去总结一大段对话，每次都会"
"失败，上下文随后会被直接裁剪掉而没有摘要。"

#: ../../configuration.md:218
msgid ""
"**Its `response_timeout` applies to the summary.** A slow summarizer "
"holds up the turn for that long before giving up. Lower it on that entry "
"if you would rather trim early than wait."
msgstr ""
"**它自己的 `response_timeout` 会作用在摘要上。** 慢的摘要模型会把这一回合拖住那么久"
"才放弃。如果你宁愿早点裁剪也不愿意等，就把该条目上的这个值调小。"

#: ../../configuration.md:221
msgid ""
"`/config` shows the effective `compaction.*` values, the status bar names"
" the entry while a summary is in flight, and `/compact log` records which"
" model produced each stored segment. Summary tokens are counted apart "
"from the conversation, on their own `compaction usage` row in `/status`, "
"so each row can be read against one model's price."
msgstr ""
"`/config` 显示生效的 `compaction.*` 值，摘要进行中时状态栏会显示正在服务它的条目，`/compact log` "
"记录每个已存段由哪个模型生成。摘要消耗的 token 与对话分开统计，在 `/status` 中单独占一行 `compaction "
"usage`，这样每一行都可以按各自模型的价格来读。"

#: ../../configuration.md:226
msgid "Data location"
msgstr "数据目录"

#: ../../configuration.md:233
msgid ""
"Sessions live under `<data_dir>/projects/<project>/`, one directory per "
"working directory. Each holds that project's session logs and a `latest` "
"pointer, so a resume stays scoped to the project it belongs to. A project"
" directory is removed once its last session expires."
msgstr ""
"Session 保存在 `<data_dir>/projects/<project>/`，每个工作目录对应一个子目录，其中存放该项目的 "
"session 日志和 `latest` 指针，因此恢复操作始终限定在所属项目内。当某个项目的最后一个 session "
"过期后，对应目录会被一并删除。"

#: ../../configuration.md:237
msgid ""
"Beside each log sits a small `<uid>.meta.json` holding what the session "
"picker shows — name, opening line, round count. The log stays the source "
"of truth; deleting a sidecar only costs that session its label in the "
"list."
msgstr ""
"每份日志旁还有一个很小的 `<uid>.meta.json`，保存 session "
"选择器所展示的内容——名称、开场行、轮数。日志始终是事实来源；删掉这个文件只会让该 session 在列表中失去标签。"

#: ../../configuration.md:241
msgid ""
"`<data_dir>/history.txt` holds the input history that Up and Ctrl-P "
"recall, across every project. It is capped at 512 KB, keeping the most "
"recent entries."
msgstr ""
"`<data_dir>/history.txt` 保存所有项目共用的输入历史，供 Up 与 Ctrl-P 调取。该文件上限为 512 "
"KB，仅保留最近的条目。"

